=== IoMT FL-IDS & Blockchain Framework — Rajab et al. Journal ===
Standards-Aligned MITM Risk Quantification and Governance
ISO Standards (own risk mappings):
  - ISO/IEEE 11073  : Clinical thresholds, wASI 5-band severity
  - ISO 14971       : Device priority scoring, 4-level action taxonomy
  - ISO/IEC 27001   : Annex A control gap (A.12.6.1/A.12.4.2/A.12.7.3)
  - ISO/IEC 27005   : CIA risk levels (None/Low/Medium/High/Critical)
IEC 80001-1 (Healthcare IT Network Governance umbrella):
  - NHS CAF-DSPT   : Domains A-D
  - NHS RAG Register: Likelihood x Impact scoring (Red/Orange/Amber/Green)
  - FDA ALARP       : Residual risk acceptability per flow
  - HL7-FHIR        : Security use-case and dimension mapping
FL-IDS: REAL per-node local models (SGD) + multi-round weighted FedAvg,
        fused with wASI>=25 domain threshold for detection.
